@baseUrl = http://localhost:5217
@apiKey = 1234567890

### Listar tareas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agenttask/tasks
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Crear una tarea
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agenttask/create
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agentId": "agent-01",
  "type": "powershell",
  "payload": "Get-Date"
}

### Enviar heartbeat de un agente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/heartbeat
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agentId": "agent-01",
  "machine": "PC-GEORGE"
}

### Sin API key (debe devolver 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agenttask/tasks
